{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは！\n愛知県出身22歳の岡本姫奈です！\nあっという間に4月だね〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "新生活がスタートした人も多いのかな〜🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "新しい環境に 緊張したり、不安だったり！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな毎日に、少しでも私が寄り添えていたら嬉しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずっと味方だよ💍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この間ね矢田ちゃんとお花見に行ってきました🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "当日急に決まったんだけど\n満開の時に行けてよかった〜☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アルバム発売記念ライブ\nアンダーライブと続いて 本当によく頑張ったね〜！！って 沢山褒め褒めしました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "レジャーシートを引いて\n3時間くらい 日向ぼっこしたり\nご飯食べたり ゴロゴロしてた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しあわせ時間！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんなに可愛い後輩が入ってきてくれて幸せです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mob2OGRRq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "え新婚さん？って写真見返して笑ってた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんなにキメてるのに"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobJyxhce.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mob1s4fwf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "頭の裏が草だらけで本当にありえなかった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "矢田ちゃんが途中で めっちゃ笑ってたから何事かと思ったよ┐(´ー｀)┌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "丁寧に全部とってくれましたありがとう😂😂\nこんな先輩でごめん😂😂😂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobKg1aHG.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "原因はきっとこれ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "格好つけたかったんだけどなあ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202604/mobdMLijL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沢山リフレッシュ出来た〜\nまた次のライブに向けて頑張ります！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それじゃあ また書きます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "花粉に負けず4月も頑張ろうね！💪🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただきありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日の一曲"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "タイムリミット片想い/乃木坂46"}], "source": "official"}